ind":"announcement","title":"Playtest #2 is Officially LIVE! 👑","summary":"Playtest #2 is officially LIVE on Steam! Whether you survived the first round or you’re fresh off the bench, it’s time to grab your squad, lock in, and get that slippery royal carcass moving again. We’ve been cooking up some sweet tweaks based on your feedback, and we need your goblin brains to test out the fresh polish. 🛠️ WHAT’S NEW IN PLAYTEST #2?Overhauled King Dragging: We reworked the pulling controls so hauling His Royal Heavy-ness feels way more physical, meaty, and responsive. Fair warn","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T17:06:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814444071","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4373420-1839041357024719","game_id":"steam-4373420","kind":"announcement","title":"👑 The Royal deadweight is moving!","summary":"The All Haul The King playtest gates opened less than a week ago, and more than 1.400 of you have already answered the call of duty. That is a lot of goblin sweat, a lot of strained backs, and way too many exploding flora incidents. We are absolutely blown away by the turnout! Speaking of the haulers... our royal telemetry shows a very clear leaderboard right now. 🏆 TOP HAULING NATIONS SO FAR: 1. 🇧🇷 Brazil 2. 🇺🇸 USA 3. 🇨🇦 Canada An absolute round of applause to our Brazilian, American, and Canad","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T17:47:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357024719","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4373420-1838407329260267","game_id":"steam-4373420","kind":"announcement","title":"The Playtest is Officially LIVE! 👑💥","summary":"Greetings, loyal goblins! First of all, a massive THANK YOU to everyone who requested access and joined our army of not-kings. The response has been incredible, and we couldn't be more excited to finally open the gates. The build is ready, the servers are up, and the King’s heavy, slippery corpse is officially waiting for you. It’s time to start hauling! This is a raw stress test, and your feedback is the most valuable loot we can get. We want to know everything: Did the physics feel chaotic eno","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-17T17:45:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329260267","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4373420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:54Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:54Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4373420":"2026-10-26T02:12:54Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4373420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4683850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4373420","app_id":4373420,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:34Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"884bab919ffaf5840bc828ff52767b6e1ca2a6053a671fa37c040febe4015fda","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"친구들과 함께 즐기는 온라인 협동 게임의 장대한 여정 속에서 거대한 고블린 왕의 시신을 왕국 반대편까지 끌고 가서 부활시키세요. 머리, 몸, 기상천외한 고블린 마법을 활용하여 앞을 가로막는 험난한 지형과 퍼즐을 헤쳐나가세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Housefire","creator_clan_account_id":457